# "Inclusion debt" was renamed "Exclusion debt" across the site (22 Sep 2026).
/inclusion-debt         /exclusion-debt    301
/inclusion-debt.html    /exclusion-debt    301

# The Unwritten Dispatches newsletter (Beehiiv) was retired in Sep 2026 in favour
# of the Exclusion Debt Substack. Old issue links land on the blog instead.
# Only takes effect once dispatches.unwritten.health is added as a domain alias
# in Netlify and its DNS record points at Netlify.
https://dispatches.unwritten.health/*    https://unwritten.health/blog    301!

# The cookie banner linked to a relative "privacy.html", which broke on pages in
# folders (e.g. /conditions/privacy.html). Fixed in analytics.js (9 Nov 2026);
# these catch the addresses Google already found.
/:folder/privacy.html    /privacy    301
/:folder/privacy         /privacy    301

